      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside the dining room of Claude Monet, the mood is heavy after Vika's painful breakup with Max. Bartender Kostya notices Nastya looking upset, and Nastya tries to comfort Vika with a glass of water while begging the pianist to play something more cheerful.",
